      <bpmn:userTask id="W3269_Task5" name="Evaluate commercialization opportunity: licensing the BuildRight brand/co-brand…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Evaluate commercialization opportunity: licensing the BuildRight brand/co-brand to partners (vendors per VS-03, retail-media partners per VS-48), potential franchising, IP monetization; assess brand-fit, financial upside, dilution risk, control; align with strategy (links to VS-33)
Responsible (R): IP Counsel / Marketing / Business Dev
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per opportunity</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3269_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
