        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Structure and negotiate license/franchise agreement: scope (territory, field, exclusivity), license grant, quality-control/brand-standards (links to VS-41.3), royalty/fees, term/termination, audit rights, indemnity, insurance (links to VS-26); Legal drafts/reviews (links to VS-22 contract review)
Responsible (R): IP Counsel / Legal / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per deal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3269_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3269_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3269_Task7" name="Administer license: track royalties and compliance, conduct quality-control…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Administer license: track royalties and compliance, conduct quality-control audits, manage renewals/terminations, enforce licensee compliance; account for IP revenue (links to VS-17); update portfolio and analytics (W3272)
Responsible (R): Legal Ops Mgr / Finance / Marketing
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3269_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3269_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
