    <bpmn:process id="W_W3270" name="W3270. Trade Secret, Confidentiality &amp; Non-Disclosure Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New confidential engagement (vendor, partner, employee); policy refresh; disclosure event
Frequency: Per engagement + ongoing
Volume: Hundreds of NDAs/confidentiality agreements; trade-secret inventory
Owner: Legal Operations Manager
Participants: Legal Ops Mgr, IP Counsel, Legal, HR (links to VS-19), IT/Security (links to VS-27.3/VS-91), Business Owners
Source: workflow W3270 — Trade Secret, Confidentiality &amp; Non-Disclosure Management</bpmn:documentation>
