      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3270_Start4" name="New confidential engagement (vendor, partner, employee); policy refresh; disclosure event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3270_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3270_Task5" name="Legal Ops Mgr maintain NDA/confidentiality agreement program: standard…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal Ops Mgr maintain NDA/confidentiality agreement program: standard mutual/one-way NDA templates (links to W3273 clause library), approve and execute NDAs for vendor/partner/employee engagements, track obligations and expiry; ensure employment/contractor agreements include confidentiality and IP-assignment (links to VS-19/VS-98)
Responsible (R): Legal Ops Mgr / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per engagement</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3270_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3270_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3270_Task6" name="Identify and protect trade secrets: inventory trade secrets (pricing/cost data…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Identify and protect trade secrets: inventory trade secrets (pricing/cost data, supplier terms per VS-03, private-label formulations per VS-41, business plans, customer data per VS-13/VS-91, source code), classify, apply access controls (links to VS-27.3/VS-91) and need-to-know, document reasonable secrecy measures (required for trade-secret protection)
Responsible (R): IP Counsel / IT / Business Owners
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3270_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3270_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3270_Task7" name="Manage disclosure and breaches: control outbound confidential disclosures…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage disclosure and breaches: control outbound confidential disclosures (evaluating partners, regulatory), respond to suspected misappropriation (enforcement per W3268 where misused), manage employee-departure confidentiality (links to VS-19.5) and contractor exit (links to VS-98 W3216)
Responsible (R): Legal Ops Mgr / IP Counsel / HR
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3270_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3270_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3270_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3270_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
