      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New brand/product (domain registration); cybersquatting/phishing detected
Frequency: Continuous + event-driven
Volume: BuildRight domain portfolio + monitoring alerts
Owner: IP Counsel
Participants: IP Counsel, Legal Ops Mgr, IT/Security (links to VS-27.3), Marketing (links to VS-14/VS-75), External Counsel
Source: workflow W3271 — Domain Name, Anti-Cybersquatting &amp; Digital IP Protection</bpmn:documentation>
