    <bpmn:process id="W_W3272" name="W3272. IP Portfolio Valuation &amp; Risk Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual reporting; transaction (acquisition/license); impairment indicator
Frequency: Annual + event-driven
Volume: IP portfolio
Owner: IP Counsel
Participants: IP Counsel, Finance (links to VS-17), Valuer, VP Legal &amp; Compliance, Marketing
Source: workflow W3272 — IP Portfolio Valuation &amp; Risk Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3272_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3272_Lane1" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3272_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3272_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3272_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3272_Lane2" name="IP Counsel">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3272_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3272_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3272_Start4" name="Annual reporting; transaction (acquisition/license); impairment indicator">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3272_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3272_Task5" name="Finance/IP Counsel value IP: capitalized development costs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance/IP Counsel value IP: capitalized development costs (acquired/internally-generated intangibles per PFRS 3/38), fair value for transactions, royalty-relief or income approach for brand value; assess useful life and amortization (links to VS-35)
Responsible (R): Finance / IP Counsel / Valuer
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Annual/event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3272_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3272_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3272_Task6" name="Assess impairment: indicators (brand decline, legal invalidation, market…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Assess impairment: indicators (brand decline, legal invalidation, market shift), impairment test, write-down where impaired (links to VS-35); reconcile to financial statements and audit (links to VS-22.2)
Responsible (R): Finance / IP Counsel
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3272_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3272_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3272_Task7" name="Report portfolio performance: registrations, renewals, enforcement outcomes…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Report portfolio performance: registrations, renewals, enforcement outcomes, licensing revenue, portfolio coverage and gaps, risk register updates (links to VS-21.2); drive strategy (W3265) and prevention
Responsible (R): IP Counsel / Legal Ops Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3272_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3272_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3272_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3272_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3272_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-154 (ensure legal matter &amp; IP portfolio control.) | - operational: impairment testing and conservative valuation; operational: commercialization (W3269)
Owner: IP Counsel</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3272_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3272_Annotation9" targetRef="W3272_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
